			PRINTFORML 당신은 \@ IsDiapered(theCulprit) ? 사용한 기저귀 # 더러워진 속옷 \@를 찾기 힘든 곳에 두고 원래 있던 곳으로 돌아간다. 
		ENDIF
		;Shinki finds your used diaper on the floor, picking it up with curiousity.
		;Having seen you suddenly not smelling anymore, she puts two and two together.
		;「Oh, what is that. Is. is that your used diaper?」
		; You can't help but just nod.
		;「Why didn't you tell me about your accident. I could've changed you.」
		;You look down at the ground embarrassed.
		;You know what you did was quite naughty, but you thought you could stop time to change yourself to get away.
		;「Ah, you stopped time to do that. No wonder why you managed to change your diaper in a flash」
